# Licensed art (LimeZu "Modern Interiors", limezu.itch.io)
# Its licence permits using and editing the assets in a project, but NOT
# redistributing them. This repository is public, so neither the pack nor
# anything derived from it may ever be committed. Each developer obtains their
# own copy — see docs/assets-setup.md — and `pnpm assets:build` turns it into
# packages/maps/generated/, which is likewise never committed.
assets/
packages/maps/generated/

